            "review_title": "Review at Lang Cua Dong Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Phuoc Dam\n1 contribution\n0\nTerrible place. Highly advised not coming here.\nDec 2018 • Friends\nCame in for lunch. The food is bland and cold, combine with the fact that it is highly overpriced makes this place horrendous than the seemingly high-quality look it has.\nMore importantly, customer service is the worst. Employees and a manager showed hostility and discrimination towards Vietnamese customers and they don't even try to hide it! They even have tricks to cut the throat of tourists. Be aware!\nI am so disgusted I have to go many places to comment this so people would know to avoid\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 29, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
