            "review_title": "Review at Lang Cua Dong Restaurant",
            "review_text": "OneLena\nSingapore, Singapore234 contributions\n1\nFantastic northern food!\nMar 2017 • Friends\nI have been going to this place for many years. It may not look fancy, but the food is first class!\n\nHere's what I recommend:\nField crab coated with sticky rice and deep fried (eat the whole thing, shell and all)\nSnails\nFlower soup\nBun (noodles) in soup with field crab\nFried crispy fish\n\nEverything on the menu is good! Go in a group so that you get to try more dishes.\n\nDrinks: try the special fruit boiled with sugar cane. It's excellent for a hot day.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 3, 2017",
